### Rename / regroup a category (replace 1 with a real id; groupId null = Ungrouped)
PUT http://localhost:8088/api/v1/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Food", "groupId": 1 }

### Delete a category (operations using it become Uncategorized)
DELETE http://localhost:8088/api/v1/categories/1
